<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <p class="mb-4 font-semibold text-indigo-700">Production-minded Rails foundation</p>
  <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">Build your multi-tenant product on a solid Rails core.</h1>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Authentication, account membership, strict tenant scoping, PostgreSQL, Docker, CI, and security tooling are ready for your product code.</p>
  <div class="mt-9 flex gap-4">
